  <title id="bdl18predictupdateproject-title">The predict-update-project cycle</title>
  <desc id="bdl18predictupdateproject-desc">Starting from the approximation q at step t minus 1, a predict arrow leads to p of t given t minus 1, an update arrow leads to the exact one-step posterior p t, and a project arrow leads down to the tractable approximation q t. The same predict, update and project sequence then leads from q t through p of t plus 1 given t and p t plus 1 to q t plus 1.</desc>
